05 May 2026: Pranav
The data had extended phase boundaries beyond the real activity end, absorbing reststop transition periods into the active phase label. This inflated phase durations to an artificial minimum of ~20 minutes and introduced non-activity data (stationary GPS, lower EDA, lower HR consistent with resting) into what should be clean active-phase signals.
The corrected approach is to rebuild from the original key file timestamps

