Comment 1  --  Data Cleaning & Descriptive Statistics
Status: Done.
The raw dataset had some missing values  --  mainly in Atmotube Left (~12% of rows) and Eyetracker (~19%, with P13 fully absent). Short gaps (up to 3 consecutive missing values) were filled using cubic spline interpolation, which preserves the smooth shape of the underlying signal. Longer gaps were filled with the within-participant phase median (median used instead of mean because the distributions are right-skewed). After cleaning, the dataset has zero missing values.
